64	     * expressed through, formatted {@code '<telephone>|<email or empty>|<householdId>'} (a
65	     * {@code null} telephone or email contributes an empty segment). Two owners are duplicates only
66	     * when their whole identity keys are equal, so household members sharing a {@code householdId} but
67	     * carrying different telephones have different keys and are not duplicates.
68	     *
